* TV3_CELLS/XOR2_TG: netlist from Virtuoso schematic
.SUBCKT XOR2_TG A B GND VDD Y
MMN3 Y A Bn GND nmos1v w=240n l=100n
MMN2 Y An B GND nmos1v w=240n l=100n
MMN1 Bn B GND GND nmos1v w=120n l=100n
MMN0 An A GND GND nmos1v w=120n l=100n
MMP3 Y An Bn VDD pmos1v w=480n l=100n
MMP2 Y A B VDD pmos1v w=480n l=100n
MMP1 Bn B VDD VDD pmos1v w=240n l=100n
MMP0 An A VDD VDD pmos1v w=240n l=100n
.ENDS XOR2_TG

